# Files committed to the repo but not relevant to the Vercel build. Mostly
# Deno Edge Function sources that run in the Supabase cloud (deployed via the
# Supabase MCP, not via Vercel) and standalone Node scripts used for one-off
# maintenance. Listing them here removes them from the build context so
# Next.js's bundled type-check never has a reason to walk their jsr:/npm:
# imports.

supabase/functions
supabase/migrations
scripts
remotion/
